Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:12.765 --> 00:00:16.902
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.952 --> 00:00:20.600
Today we learn: Numbers and Time. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.273 --> 00:00:24.440
One. Say it with me. One!

6
00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.307
Ten. Say it with me. Ten!

7
00:00:34.829 --> 00:00:38.446
Hundred. Say it with me. Hundred!

8
00:00:41.964 --> 00:00:45.298
Hour. Say it with me. Hour!

9
00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:52.627
Minute. Say it with me. Minute!

10
00:00:56.073 --> 00:00:59.540
Clock. Say it with me. Clock!

11
00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:06.600
Early. Say it with me. Early!

12
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.667
Late. Say it with me. Late!

13
00:01:17.165 --> 00:01:21.065
Schedule. Say it with me. Schedule!

14
00:01:24.569 --> 00:01:28.102
Watch. Say it with me. Watch!

15
00:01:31.636 --> 00:01:40.418
Grammar time! Telling time. Listen. It is one o'clock. I wake up early.

16
00:01:40.468 --> 00:01:46.284
Your turn. Say it with me. It is one o'clock. I wake up early.

17
00:01:51.325 --> 00:01:59.745
The clock shows the hour and minute. I count from one to ten, sometimes even to a hundred. I try not to be late.

18
00:01:59.795 --> 00:02:01.326
I like this story!

19
00:02:02.311 --> 00:02:07.626
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:07.676 --> 00:02:08.826
Hundred!

21
00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:15.101
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:15.151 --> 00:02:16.301
Early!

23
00:02:17.059 --> 00:02:25.016
Think and answer. What time do you usually wake up?

24
00:02:25.066 --> 00:02:26.240
Great answer!

25
00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:31.761
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
